    "media:imagetext": "USAir\nDo you want to enjoy a relaxing, private getaway\nbefore, between or after flights-join the Club. The\nUSAir Club. We offer 29 USAir Clubs in 23 major\nairport locations.\nYou will enjoy the advantages of one of the world's\nfinest airline clubs-including:\n• Free use of photocopiers and personal\ncomputers at every Club location\n• Friendly, experienced USAir Club staff\n• Free use of Club phones for local calls\n• Use of private conference rooms in most\nClub locations for a nominal fee\n• Facsimile machine use with a credit card\n• Cocktail service, plus free soft drinks,\ncoffee, juice and snacks\nTo begin enjoying First Class treatment from the\nground up, complete the application at the back of\nthis timetable, or stop by any USAir ticket counter\nor USAir Club location.\nWITH OUR CONNECTIONS,\nYOU CAN GO A LONG WAY.\nSOENVER\nGOALLAS. FORT WORT\n• USAIR\nAUSAIR EXPRESS\n•USAIR/USAIR EXPRESS\nTogether, USAir and USAir Express have over 5,000 flights a day to more\nthan 270 cities across the U.S. and Canada. Plus flights to Bermuda, the Bahamas,\nPuerto Rico, London, Frankfurt and Paris. So when it's time to travel, remember the\nairlines that are well connected: USAir and USAir Express. For reservations and\ninformation, call your travel consultant or USAir toll-free 1(800)428-4322.\nUSAir\nUSAir\nEXPRESS\nUSAir huttle",
